                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "defensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>30 feet. All allies with swarm mind within the listed range of each other are in constant telepathic communication and are aware of all threats they know about. While within range of at least one ally with swarm mind, when a hive-minded prisoner rolls a success on a save against a mental effect, it gets a critical success instead.</p>"
