        {
            "_id": "NQkbT01Un9i7rR2h",
            "img": "systems/sf2e/icons/actions/OneAction.webp",
            "name": "Join Us!",
            "sort": 700000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "action"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": 1
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>The hive-minded prisoner reaches out, attempting to add one creature within 60 feet to its malformed hive mind. The target must attempt a @Check[will|dc:24] saving throw as the collective consciousness tears at their mind.</p><hr /><p><strong>Success</strong> The target is unaffected and is immune to Join Us! for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target becomes @UUID[Compendium.sf2e.conditions.Item.Confused] for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target becomes confused for 1 round and can't target kucharns while confused in this way</p>"
